**Floor.** At `W=2` one has `S=1`, so Q1 gives `n_min ≥ N` for the whole column, independently of `β`. That is the n-floor prize the producer attached to a YES on Q2. The integer S-known ceil rises iff `W−S` divides `N−1`; it is not a +1 at every cell of the `Phi` table.

